{"purpose":"Mendefinisikan field provenance terdistribusi untuk semua CKO agar capture direct task bisa berlaku universal (bukan per-device), mendukung filtering, dedupe, dan audit traceability tanpa mem-pollute canonical store.","content":"# Spec — Provenance Capture Field (universal)\n\n## 1. Tujuan\nMenstandarkan metadata provenance pada setiap CKO/draft agar Inferred Direct Task Capture (ADR-035 v3) berjalan universal via eka-core gateway + eka-standard hook, bukan config per-device.\n\n## 2. Schema\nField baru di CKO envelope (eka/structured-json/1):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"provenance\": \"human | inferred | reconciled\",\n  \"sourcePromptHash\": \"sha256 hex (optional, untuk inferred)\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0,\n  \"sourceCommitSha\": \"hex (optional, untuk reconciled)\",\n  \"captureMeta\": {\n    \"classifier\": \"keyword-heuristic v1\",\n    \"dedupeKey\": \"normalized-title-hash\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- `human` (default): dibuat eksplisit via `eka new` / `eka publish` manual\n- `inferred`: gateway `eka-core/runtime.Authoring` auto-draft dari prompt (Step 1 ADR-035)\n- `reconciled`: hook `eka capture --reconcile --from-git` dari git diff (Step 3 ADR-035)\n\nField wajib ada di draft (default `human`), di-persist ke canonical store saat publish. Non-breaking: `eka get` tanpa filter menampilkan semua; flag `--provenance human|inferred|all` untuk filter.\n\n## 3. Gateway (Layer 1 — eka-core)\n- Lokasi: `eka-core/runtime.Authoring.CaptureService` (sejajar `codegraph`)\n- Trigger: setiap `Authoring.NewDraft` / `MCP authoring` sebelum `Validate`. Classifier deterministik: cek verb `fix/add/change/decide/update/remove` + panjang \u003e=10 kata + `confidence \u003e=0.6` (threshold dari `eka.yaml capture.threshold`). Tanpa LLM wajib; LLM opsional sebagai plugin Tooling.\n- Action: jika signifikan, auto-call `NewDraft` dengan `provenance=inferred`, `sourcePromptHash=sha256(prompt)`, `confidence`, dan `relationships` via `context.Engine` lookup ke `sto/plan` terdekat.\n- Dedupe: `dedupeKey = hash(normalized-title)` dalam `capture.dedupeWindow` (default 24h, dari `eka.yaml`). Jika match, bukan CKO baru melainkan `cmt:note` `discusses` target existing.\n\n## 4. Hook Terdistribusi (Layer 2 — eka-standard + anvil)\n- Template: `eka-standard/templates/hooks/pre-commit` + `pre-push` di-commit, di-install via `anvil install` fase `platform_sync` (symlink ke `.git/hooks/`).\n- Hook: jalankan `eka capture --reconcile --from-git` (binary `eka` sama). Baca `git diff --cached` / `git log --since=24h --patch`, klasifikasi heuristic; jika signifikan tanpa draft ter-link, generate draft `provenance=reconciled`, `sourceCommitSha`, `confidence=0.5`.\n- Distribusi: versioned di `eka-standard`; update via `anvil update` / bump standard.\n\n## 5. Repo Config (Layer 3)\n`eka.yaml`:\n```yaml\ncapture:\n  enabled: true\n  threshold: 0.6\n  dedupeWindow: 24h\n  provenanceFilterDefault: all\n```\nKe-commit, berlaku untuk semua clone/CI.\n\n## 6. Validasi \u0026 Publish\n- `eka draft validate` cek `provenance` enum valid; `inferred`/`reconciled` tetap harus lolos semua rule (R0-R13) termasuk stratifikasi.\n- `eka publish --all` topologikal (Kahn) tetap, R13 note gates tidak di-bypass.\n- `eka draft list`, `eka status`, `eka context` surface tag `[inferred]` / `[reconciled]` dan filter `--provenance`.\n- `eka sync push` membawa provenance ke snapshot (non-breaking, field di `content` bukan di identity).\n\n## 7. Non-Goals\n- Tidak ada auto-publish (tetap human-in-the-loop).\n- Tidak perubahan RSF/CKO identity; provenance di `content` bukan di `identity`.\n- Tidak LLM wajib; embedding/RAG tetap plugin opsional per ADR-034.\n\n## 8. Penerimaan (Acceptance)\n- `eka new` tanpa provenance → default `human`\n- Gateway auto-draft ter-test di `eka-core` unit test dengan threshold 0.6 ± dedupe\n- Hook ter-install via `anvil install` di CI fixture dan generate `reconciled` draft\n- `eka draft list --provenance inferred` filter bekerja\n- `eka validate` reject provenance invalid\n"}